The Keeper of Chains is a hulking, skull-faced figure in robes, a general in [[Sigzil Haight]]'s service. He wields a flaming greataxe, and he can point a finger and speak a killing word.

He is the general Sigzil sent to the chamber of the [[Voice of Many]] when it was freed. The Voice of Many's restored magic blew him out of the room, and he is still alive.
